    {
      "title": "Prospectus Summary",
      "excerpt": "PROSPECTUS SUMMARY 2 RISK FACTORS 9 CAUTIONARY NOTE REGARDING FORWARD-LOOKING STATEMENTS 16 MARKET, INDUSTRY AND OTHER DATA 17 USE OF PROCEEDS 18 PRIVATE PLACEMENT OF WARRANTS 19 SELLING STOCKHOLDER 20 PLAN OF DISTRIBUTION 22 DESCRIPTION OF SECURITIES 25 LEGAL MATTERS 31 EXPERTS 31 WHERE YOU CAN FIND ADDITIONAL INFORMATION 31 INCORPORATION OF CERTAIN INFORMATION BY REFERENCE 32 i ABOUT THIS PROSPECTUS This prospectus is part of a registration statement on Form S-1 (Reg. No. 333-289946) that we filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission (the \u201cCommission\u201d) using a \u201cshelf\u201d registration process. Under this shelf registration process, the Selling Stockholder may, from time to time, offer and sell our securities, as described in this prospectus, in one or more offerings. We will not receive any proceeds from the sale by the Selling Stockholder of the securities offered by them described",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    },
    {
      "title": "Use of Proceeds",
      "excerpt": "Use of proceeds The Warrants and Warrant Shares to be offered and sold using this prospectus will be offered and sold by the Selling Stockholder named in this prospectus. Accordingly, we will not receive any proceeds from any sale of Warrants or Warrant Shares of our Common Stock in this offering. See \u201c Use of Proceeds .\u201d National Securities Exchange Listing Our Common Stock is listed on The Nasdaq Global Select Market under the symbol \u201cGPRO.\u201d There is currently no public market for the Warrants. We do not intend to apply for listing of the Warrants on a national securities exchange or over the counter market. Risk Factors See \u201c Risk Factors \u201d beginning on page 9 and the other information included in this prospectus for a discussion of factors you should carefully consider before investing in our securities. In addition, before deciding whether to invest, you should consider carefully th",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    },
    {
      "title": "Risk Factors",
      "excerpt": "RISK FACTORS Investing in our securities involves a high degree of risk. Prior to making a decision about investing in our securities, you should carefully consider the risks and uncertainties described below, together with all of the other information set forth in this prospectus or incorporated herein by reference, including the consolidated financial statements and related notes, and the risks and uncertainties discussed under \u201cRisk Factors\u201d in Part I, Item 1A of our Annual Report on Form 10-K for the year ended December 31, 2025, as amended by the Form 10-K Amendment, and as updated by our Quarterly Reports on Form 10-Q for the quarter ended March 31, 2026, as amended by the Q1 Form 10-Q Amendment, and June 30, 2026, as amended by the Q2 Form 10-Q Amendment, which are incorporated by reference herein in their entirety. If any of the risks described herein or therein actually occur, o",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
  ],
